\section{Conclusion}\label{sec5}
This paper proposes an efficient SK-type coding scheme for the quasi-static fading channel with I-CSIT and QFC, and establishes the rate-CSI estimation distortion tradeoff under given coding blocklength and decoding error probability.
Numerical results show that the quantized feedback combined with I-CSIT still bring FBL rate gain to the quasi-static fading channel with perfect CSI at both parties and without feedback.

