\caption{\textbf{Vibrational spectra and OH population dynamics of \ce{(H2O)21} outside the optical cavity} (a) Schematic depiction of \ce{(H2O)21} placed inside and outside the optical cavity. (b) Vibrational spectra of \ce{(H2O)21} outside the cavity from anharmonic VSCF/VCI calculation and experimental IR spectrum of liquid water.\cite{bertie1996infrared} (c-d) Examples of time-dependent population of the OH stretch in monomer 1 (w1) and monomer 7 (w7) from 3 mode or 6 mode calculations. 3 mode calculation involves the bend ($\nu_{\text{b}}$) and two OH stretches ( $\nu_{\text{OH1}},\nu_{\text{OH2}}$) of one monomer. 6 mode calculation includes three additional low-frequency intermolecular modes ($\nu_1$,$\nu_2$,$\nu_3$)}
\label{fig1}
