\textbf{Input:} List of polynomials $\mathcal{F}_n=\{f_{1},\dots,f_{r}\}$ in variables $x_1,\dots,x_n$.

\textbf{Output:} Returns a boolean indicating if there exists a point in which all polynomials are strictly positive, and if so, it returns one such point as a hash table.

