\section{Data preprocessing}
To ensure a smooth handling of input data, maintaining the same input shape to the neural network and to preserve the grid resolution without loss of data that typically occurs when interpolating onto a uniform grid, the data from the O-grid was reshaped into a neat 2D array.
The process of reshaping is highlighted in~\Cref{fig:transi_sims_plots2}.
We start at the TE and move clockwise along the airfoil surface to loop till we reach back to the TE.
This forms the first bottom--most layer of the 2D array.
We then move to the next layer and repeat till all the layers are completed.

