\subsection{Training}
The neural network was trained using the FT-airfoils dataset.
400,000 simulations from the dataset were used for training.
During the training process, the convolutional network and DNN errors were plotted against the number of epochs.
We use the following metrics for the loss function
\begin{equation}
\begin{aligned}
\text{loss}_{\text{encoder-decoder}} &= \frac{1}{n_{\text{sample}}}\sum_i\frac{\norm{C^{(i)}_{p, \text{real}} - C^{(i)}_{p, \text{pred}}}}{\norm{C^{(i)}_{p, \text{real}}}}, \\
\text{loss}_{\text{DNN}} &= \frac{1}{n_{\text{sample}}}\sum_i\frac{\norm{C^{(i)}_{p, \text{real}} - C^{(i)}_{p, \text{pred}}}}{\norm{C^{(i)}_{p, \text{real}}}}, \\
\end{aligned}
\label{eq:loss}
\end{equation}
where $C_{p,\text{real}}$ is the pressure coefficient from the ground--truth data and $C_{p,\text{pred}}$ is the pressure coefficient from the predicted data.
