We evaluate the model’s accuracy in reproducing the pressure coefficient ($C_p$) fields of airfoils by computing the $L_2$ norm of the error between the predicted and ground truth values. 
Notably, higher $L_2$ norm errors are observed for the 3\textsuperscript{rd} and 4\textsuperscript{th} airfoils in~\Cref{fig:turb_out}, each with an error of approximately 0.131.

To further examine the model’s performance, we plot the absolute error field~(\Cref{fig:turb_out}),
