\subsection{Crash Severity}\label{crash-severity-2}

We applied the random forest classification model to the dataset to study the impact on crash severity models. Figure~\ref{fig_cs_feasures} presents the top 15 feature importances identified by a random forest classification model analyzing the impact on crash severity. The most important features include log\_aadt, log\_truck, IRI, FRICT, LARGEST\_CRUVE, FRICT, and RUT.

