	\begin{abstract}
	In this paper we use free iterated actions and the iterated discrete degree of symmetry introduced in \cite{daura2025IGG1} to obtain rigidity results on aspherical manifolds. We also introduce the concept of the length of an iterated action and we study it for nilmanifolds, solvmanifold and locally symmetric spaces.
