The next section discusses the framework for calculating the polarization charge density.
The diamagnetic polarization paradox and the resolution to the paradox are explained in Sec.~\ref{sec:diamag_paradox}, while the detailed derivations are presented in the remainder of the paper.   
Drift theory, presented in Sec.~\ref{sec:real_space}, considers adiabatic theory in real space and 
