\subsection{Implementation Details}
The proposed framework is implemented using PyTorch and trained for 15 epochs with a batch size of 2 on a RTX 3090 GPU. We adopt Res2Net-50 \cite{gao2019res2net}, pretrained on ImageNet, as the backbone. During training and inference, a video clip of $T=3$ frames is selected. All input images are resized to 352 $\times$ 352 resolution and augmented with random flipping. Optimization is performed using Adam optimizer with an initial learning rate of 0.0001 and weight decay of 0.0005.


