\end{equation}
where $\mu$ is the chemical potential. As $g$ is increased, larger values of $N$ are necessary for convergence to $\mu$. In particular for this system, we find that $N=35$ is sufficient in all three of these cases to see reasonable convergence in $E/N$. 
