\section{Manifestations of the Newton numbers}


\subsection{Preliminaries: Mixed volume, Cayley sums, BKK-theorem}\label{Mixed_cayley_rec_subsec}

%Let us recall some definitions from convex geometry. For more details see e.g. \cite{Ew} or \cite{TOJ}. 

