    where $\Ps^\rho = \Ds_\rho\ast \Ps_1\ast\dots\ast \Ps_m \subset \R^{m}_{\ge 0} \oplus \R^{n-m}$. Note that the first $m$ polytopes in the above mixed volume are $\conv(\Ps_1), \dots, \conv(\Ps_m)$. 
