	The mesh, relaxation equation solver, and time integration schemes are kept identical to the previous example.
	The mathematical entropy $H$ of the \ac{MHD} equations is also the same as in the Euler case.
	On average, only one to two Newton iterations are performed per timestep for the \ac{PERRK} methods.
